...
__host__ __device__ void scatterRay()</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Material Sorting</h3>
        <p>
          Grouped rays by material ID before shading to improve memory contiguity and reduce GPU warp divergence. The optimization is controlled by <code>SORT_MATERIAL</code> for performance comparison.
        </p>
        <pre class="language-cpp"><code>// Group paths by material ID before shading.
thrust::stable_sort_by_key(materialIds, materialIds + num_paths, paths);</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Stochastic Antialiasing</h3>
        <p>
          Added sub-pixel jitter during ray generation. Random offsets in the [0, 1) range smooth jagged edges through Monte Carlo convergence.
        </p>
